Recommends: python3-pil
Description: Compress your images
 Curtail (previously ImCompressor) is an useful image compressor, supporting PNG, JPEG,
 WebP and SVG file types. It support both lossless and lossy compression modes with an
 option to whether keep or not metadata of images. It is inspired by Trimage and
 Image-Optimizer.